  "title": "Tupac Shakur's Accused Killer Trials Begin in Las Vegas",
  "summary": "The trial of former gang leader Duane Davis, accused of orchestrating a 1996 drive-by killing of Tupac Shakur, is set to begin in Las Vegas. The court will hear testimonies from witnesses and a former police officer, with prosecutors alleging Davis was the 'on-site commander' of the effort to kill Shakur in retaliation for his entourage's attack on Davis's nephew.",
